======================================================================================
FUNDING IS A TRANSFER, NOT A FEE
======================================================================================
  picks, longs   funding costs -0.0002 R
  picks, shorts  funding costs -0.0003 R

  A negative number is INCOME. MEXC does not charge funding —
  longs and shorts pay each other, so the side that is not
  crowded is paid to hold. Averaging the two hides that, which
  is why they are split here.

======================================================================================
WHAT IS STILL MISSING
======================================================================================
  SLIPPAGE on the stop. A market order in a fast move fills beyond
  the spread and there is no way to measure that from candles.
  SPREAD AT THE TIME OF THE FILL. The book has no history here, so
  one calm-conditions reading stands in for every past trade. Stops
  fire in the opposite conditions, so the spread column is a FLOOR.
  Both keep every net figure above OPTIMISTIC.
